{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>חף אנכי</b> — Some say: it is like 'covered from sin,' and this is close. Others say: it is suffused with righteousness, in the manner of 'Righteousness I wore and it clothed me.' And most of the commentators interpreted it: according to the context, like זך (pure)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:18.748345148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}